  "keyFeatures": [
    "Consolidated order endpoint supporting LIMIT, MARKET, PEGGED, TWAP, ICEBERG, STOP_LOSS, TAKE_PROFIT, and TRAILING_STOP order types",
    "Protective bracket orders (take-profit and stop-loss) attached to LIMIT/MARKET buys",
    "Multi-leg RFQ combo/parlay positions (2–10 legs)",
    "Copy-trading engine that mirrors leader fills with configurable sizing modes",
    "Paper/simulation trading for back-testing copy strategies without real capital",
    "Trader analytics: PnL leaderboards, wallet profiles, cumulative PnL series, and positions",
    "PMWAS tax statements: Form-8949-style dispositions, realized summaries, fee breakdowns, reconciliation certificates",
    "Partner user provisioning (white-label embedded wallets on Polymarket)"
  ],
